      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is a very technical request that the average userbase wouldn't understand, so I don't anticipate a lot of people joining onto this canny because they likely won't understand it.\nBut for avatar creators that like to make some of the really fun zany stuff this would be a huge addition to the SDK. I think most users won't know what this means, but they'll see complex and creative avatars come from this if it were implemented",
