      "statusChangeNewStatus": "available in future release",
      "value": "Today, we started an open beta of VRChat Constraints, where one of the advanced options is solving constraints in local space as described here. Instructions for taking part are available on our Discord server.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
